{'symbol': 'SO', 'date': '2022-05-05 22:33:00', 'title': 'SOUTHERN COMPANY ANNOUNCES SUCCESSFUL REMARKETING', 'text': 'ATLANTA , MAY 5, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SOUTHERN COMPANY (NYSE: SO) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS SUCCESSFULLY REMARKETED ITS SERIES 2019A REMARKETABLE JUNIOR SUBORDINATED NOTES DUE AUGUST 1, 2024 (THE "SERIES 2019A NOTES") AND ITS SERIES 2019B REMARKETABLE JUNIOR SUBORDINATED NOTES DUE AUGUST 1, 2027 (THE "SERIES 2019B NOTES" AND, TOGETHER WITH THE SERIES 2019A NOTES, THE "NOTES"). THE OPTIONAL REMARKETING WAS CONDUCTED PURSUANT TO THE TERMS OF THE GOVERNING DOCUMENTS FOR THE NOTES, WHICH WERE ORIGINALLY ISSUED ON AUGUST 16, 2019, AS A PART OF SOUTHERN COMPANY\'S 2019 SERIES A CORPORATE UNITS (THE "CORPORATE UNITS").'}